// IntroString :
"P2528875433" "<color red>This mission involves the PvP zone 'Warburg'. While conducting missions in this zone, you may be attacked by other hostile players. Only accept this mission if you are willing to experience Player versus Player content</color> <br><br>Ever been to Warburg, {VillainName}? The atmosphere can best be described as chaotic, but it's often in chaos that you find your real opportunities for power. You should talk to the Arachnos Warburg Liaison in St. Martial. She can tell you how to get there, if you want to go. <color red>Remember that Warburg is a Player versus Player zone, and a free-fire zone at that. Anyone can attack anyone once you're outside the safe zone. </color>"
// AcceptString :
"P3411416864" "Talk to the Arachnos Warburg Liaison"
// SendOffString :
"P3186422873" ""Don't kid yourself; Warburg is pretty dangerous. <br><br> <color red>Warburg is a PVP zone, where you may be killed by other players.</color>"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2536354830" "They're waiting for you. Talk to the liaison to find out more about Warburg!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1376081387" "Greetings, {VillainName}. I am the Arachnos Liaison for the Free-Fire PvP zone of Warburg. <color red>Warburg is a Player Vs. Player zone. It is also free-fire, meaning that anyone can attack anyone else outside of the safe areas, whether they are heroes or villains.</color> Warburg is VERY dangerous, and if you go there, you almost certainly will be attacked by other people. <color red>Do not enter Warburg unless you are willing to engage in Player Vs. Player combat</color>. <br><br>If you are interested in entering Warburg, you may do so by speaking to the Pilot behind me. Once there, you may speak with Warzone Operative Braun to get missions inside the zone. He can be found within the safe area. <color red>Braun's missions will take place in a PvP zone. Don't accept them if you are not willing to experience Player versus Player content.</color>."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - WB_Operative_Goddard_Intro 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4039498088" "Ever been to Warburg, {VillainName}. I recommend you go. The atmosphere can best be described as chaotic, but it's often in chaos that you find your real opportunities for power. You should talk to Operative Braun who's running the offensive against Longbow in Warburg. He may be able to use your help."
// AcceptString :
"P84050575" "Talk to Operative Braun"
// SendOffString :
"P2769777605" ""Don't kid yourself; Operative Braun's tasks are pretty dangerous. <br><br> <color red>Operative Braun's tasks will send you into a PVP zone, where you may be killed by other players.</color>"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2847708472" "Braun's waiting on you. Get your tail over to Warburg!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3152304777" "Marshal Blitz has gone rogue and taken over the island. With both sides attempting to seize control of the rocket, there are still many other tasks that need to be done to support the battle. That's where I come in. By completing missions in this zone, we can hurt the heroes who have are working with Longbow, and assist all the other villains fighting for control of the rocket. <color red>All of my missions will take place in Warburg, and while my missions are all against Longbow, you might still meet hostile players while getting to them. So, if you're not interesting in PvP, You might want to pursue another contact.</color>"
